# Solreign role pack — Assistant jobs (Medical Intern, Research Assistant,
# Engineering Apprentice, Cargo Trainee, Kitchen Hand).
# Acid-green corporate voice; PG; new-player-friendly, low-access onboarding tier.

# Medical Intern
job-name-solreign-medical-intern = Medical Intern
job-description-solreign-medical-intern = Welcome to Week One of the Solreign Wellness Track. Hand out bandages, dispense reassurance, and practice bedside manner on anyone who holds still long enough. Reports to the Chief Medical Officer, and to whoever is currently bleeding.

# Research Assistant
job-name-solreign-research-assistant = Research Assistant
job-description-solreign-research-assistant = Enrolled in the Solreign Discovery Track. Your NDA is thicker than your lab manual. Mix reagents, log anomalies, and report anything that glows before it reports itself to the rest of the station. Reports to the Research Director.

# Engineering Apprentice
job-name-solreign-engineering-apprentice = Engineering Apprentice
job-description-solreign-engineering-apprentice = Solreign's Engineering Apprenticeship Program — unpaid overtime not included, but the coffee is free. Hold the wrench, watch the breaker, and do not touch anything labeled "do not touch" until the Chief Engineer says otherwise. Reports to the Chief Engineer.

# Cargo Trainee
job-name-solreign-cargo-trainee = Cargo Trainee
job-description-solreign-cargo-trainee = First rung on the Solreign supply-chain ladder. Sort crates, page the Quartermaster before opening anything that hums, and remember: the shuttle timer waits for no one. Reports to the Quartermaster.

# Kitchen Hand
job-name-solreign-kitchen-hand = Kitchen Hand
job-description-solreign-kitchen-hand = Solreign Culinary Onboarding, Day One. Chop what the Chef tells you to chop, wash what the Chef tells you to wash, and never touch the good knives without asking first. Reports to the Chef.

# Playtime-tracker display names (same idiom as the Job* keys in job-names.ftl).
